32", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974738_738724233735765_3577901565849193922_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MhqD8u3E-qkQ7kNvwGtzV-O&_nc_oc=AdoNn_FQG3SPgH92G3gQpjvB8HbRfRB90N6HWl3gkU8P6VLo6g7hFviHloBhsVQb0UU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQScjMB4_O_ge1EHOcS9OMGQrSTfxYPmrD7RQ3B29hJ6vQ&oe=6AF5D358"}, {"file_name": "Reakt-Screenshot-3.png", "id": "396519534970476", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036631_396519538303809_8389599908014284699_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fxL4NWCqU-wQ7kNvwGnNX4X&_nc_oc=AdqtjXYM7nR65Ebsk43GxSnj0WBEePe8C9uUcQvmA2SI3XnRMKbZ1kkBLpH968I0UA8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRbZpu0YWDgdo4filGH_cfi5m7itWnilAlr5JNISfE6tg&oe=6AF5D39F"}, {"file_name": "Reakt-Screenshot-4.png", "id": "412563940069058", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974469_412563943402391_8676866923435539565_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mDZjx4901GoQ7kNvwFOnau8&_nc_oc=AdpJMa3V06KdGYSgANd7SspXoAM8wtPVSbPZvOKxM597Wizm0QF6nllTKhBpsqIOAqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTL0iTgaUurdPbWMbWrsVnZMc_enMyjx6tFX5GSNqmk7g&oe=6AF5C2D2"}, {"file_name": "Reakt-Screenshot-5.png", "id": "214280677003968", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974908_214280680337301_119073346397325500_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HC71MuJQH-EQ7kNvwHEuCbf&_nc_oc=AdpnNJd9TcKf1IBYyDx49ehqrTnOZF8QNl62lqGFLfP21fb5hEotd_EN0k9sjMM3uP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSDVUs9HJIk1SUtDd2qG12bu5IvhTTxBnNpeXF8rN7qRA&oe=6AF5CD69"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "reakt-cover-landscape.png", "id": "439191337212612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974820_439191340545945_7366567388137331232_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l8QpbHMzwRMQ7kNvwGYnq-9&_nc_oc=AdorYf5MlAB07n8yolPI1QvGLhB8BQ8bSwgu984b1rPkpK9TEQPd8tSoqbWgcIlGAKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSuU7X2BI0oSa2YB4y6Kb3g4wBZT5UlOOuzP69AMtUs4Q&oe=6AF5C64F"}, "display_name": "REAKT Performance Trainer", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Training", "Focus", "health", "target"], "long_description": "TRAIN YOUR MIND - GET IN THE ZONE.\n\nBoost your mental skills like an elite athlete! \n\nREAKT Performance Trainer is the first virtual mental skills training system that will make you a better competitor. \n\nBased on technology originally developed for athletes, REAKT will make your brain perform faster with intense training and competition modes. \n\nFAST-PACED TRAINING\nStep inside a virtual athletic training gym and push your mind and body to the limit. \n\nIMPROVE SKILLS THAT MATTER\nBoost your reaction time, decision making, and hand-eye coordination.\n\nTRACK YOUR PROGRESS\nGet real-time feedback to map your progress and hone your skills.\n\nCOMPETE FOR THE TOP SPOT\nCompete against other athletes and get your name on the leaderboard with the highest REAKT score.\n\nSTAY SHARP AND FOCUSED FOR LONGER\nFeel like nothing will get by you in your life or your sport.\n\nWEEKLY CHALLENGES\nEarn badges and trophies with new weekly challenges designed to push your training even further!", "short_description": "TRAIN YOUR MIND - GET IN THE ZONE. \n\nBoost your mental skills like an elite athlete! \n\nREAKT Performance Trainer is the first virtual mental skills training system that will make you a better competitor. \n\nNEW: Earn badges and trophies with new weekly challenges!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.reakttrainer.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NeuroTrainer", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ReaktTrainer.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_c